From 44dcd4333612be80f977f8c2766d1f683e4a4aac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 08:09:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: enforce JWT auth and per-user data ownership on
 projects/tasks

- Add protect middleware to verify JWT and attach req.user
- Add owner field to Project, scope create/list to req.user
- Scope task create/read/update/delete through the parent project's owner
- Restrict task updates to whitelisted fields (title, status) instead of
  trusting req.body wholesale
- Add mongo service container to CI and tests proving the auth guard
  rejects unauthenticated/invalid requests, plus ownership-boundary tests
  for projects and tasks
